<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AI Security Camera System | Security Camera Monitoring Interface</title>
  <style>
    @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap");

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background: #000000;
    }

    /* Navigation Bar */
    .navbar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 90px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 40px;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100%;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .logo img {
      height: 70%;
      width: auto;
      max-width: 500px;
      object-fit: contain;
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;
      image-rendering: crisp-edges;
      transform: scaleX(1.15);
    }

    .logo img:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px) scaleX(1.15);
      filter: brightness(1.08);
    }

    .nav-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 32px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffe5 0%, #00b8d4 100%);
      color: #000000;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.3);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .nav-button::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -100%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,
          transparent,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3),
          transparent);
      transition: left 0.5s;
    }

    .nav-button:hover::before {
      left: 100%;
    }

    .nav-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.5);
    }

    .section {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
      padding: 100px 20px 60px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .section-dark {
      background: #000000;
    }

    .section-gray {
      background: #262625;
    }

    .parallax-bg {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,
          rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.1) 0%,
          transparent 50%);
      transform: translateZ(-1px) scale(1.5);
      transition: transform 0.5s ease-out;
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(50px);
      animation: fadeInUp 1s ease forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .section:nth-child(2) .content {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    .section:nth-child(3) .content {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffe5 0%, #00b8d4 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #00ffe5;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
      color: #cccccc;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: #00ffe5;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 40px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .stat-item {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.8);
      animation: scaleIn 0.6s ease forwards;
    }

    .stat-item:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0.3s;
    }

    .stat-item:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }

    .stat-item:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.5s;
    }

    .stat-item:nth-child(4) {
      animation-delay: 0.6s;
    }

    @keyframes scaleIn {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
      }
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffe5 0%, #00b8d4 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      line-height: 1.3;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
      color: #999999;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .cards-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.2);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      animation: slideUp 0.8s ease forwards;
    }

    .card:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    .card:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }

    @keyframes slideUp {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      border-color: #00ffe5;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.3);
    }

    .icon {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffe5 0%, #00b8d4 100%);
      border-radius: 15px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
      font-size: 35px;
    }

    .icon svg {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      fill: #000000;
    }

    .feature-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 50px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .feature-item {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border-left: 4px solid #00ffe5;
      padding: 25px 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateX(-30px);
      animation: slideRight 0.8s ease forwards;
    }

    .feature-item:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    .feature-item:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.3s;
    }

    .feature-item:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }

    @keyframes slideRight {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateX(0);
      }
    }

    .feature-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #00ffe5;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: #00ffe5;
      min-width: 28px;
    }

    .feature-icon svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      fill: #00ffe5;
    }

    .feature-desc {
      color: #aaaaaa;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .contact-card {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.05);
      border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.3);
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 35px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .contact-card:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.1);
      border-color: #00ffe5;
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.2);
    }

    .contact-icon {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #00ffe5;
    }

    .contact-icon svg {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      fill: #00ffe5;
    }

    .contact-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .contact-detail {
      color: #aaaaaa;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .scroll-indicator {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 30px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      animation: bounce 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes bounce {

      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
      }

      50% {
        transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(15px);
      }
    }

    .arrow-down {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-left: 3px solid #00ffe5;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #00ffe5;
      transform: rotate(-45deg);
    }

    /* Footer Section */
    .footer {
      background: #000000;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.2);
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }

    .footer-content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 25px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .social-icon {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.1);
      border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.3);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .social-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      fill: #00ffe5;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .social-icon:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffe5 0%, #00b8d4 100%);
      border-color: #00ffe5;
      transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.1);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 255, 229, 0.4);
    }

    .social-icon:hover svg {
      fill: #000000;
    }

    .copyright {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #999999;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .footer {
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }

      .social-links {
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .social-icon {
        width: 45px;
        height: 45px;
      }

      .social-icon svg {
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
      }

      .copyright {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 100px 15px 40px;
      }

      .navbar {
        padding: 0 20px;
        height: 70px;
      }

      .logo img {
        height: 100%;
        max-width: 375px;
        transform: scaleX(1.12);
      }

      .nav-button {
        padding: 10px 24px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .cards-grid,
      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <!-- Navigation Bar -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="logo" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
      <span style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:900;color:#00ffe5;letter-spacing:-1px;">Cam<span
          style="color:#ffffff;">Watch</span></span>
    </div>
    <a href="/login" class="nav-button">LOGIN</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="parallax-bg"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <h1>
        AI Security<br />
        <span class="gradient-text">Camera System</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600">
        Security Camera Monitoring Interface &mdash; Intelligent Surveillance using Deep Learning &amp; Computer Vision
      </p>
      <p>
        A real-time AI-powered security camera monitoring platform.
        The system integrates YOLO-based object detection, live video analysis, and a modern web dashboard
        to deliver smart, automated surveillance for campuses and public spaces.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-indicator">
      <div class="arrow-down"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="section section-gray">
    <div class="parallax-bg"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2><span class="gradient-text">About This Project</span></h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 30px">
        This platform was developed as a production-ready intelligent surveillance system,
        focusing on building an end-to-end security camera monitoring interface
        using modern web technologies and AI-powered video analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        The system provides a full-stack solution — from live camera feed ingestion
        and AI-based detection to a user-friendly web dashboard. Users can add
        cameras, view live feeds, manage favourites, and trigger AI analysis on
        recorded footage in real time.
      </p>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">YOLO</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Object Detection</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">Node</div>
          <div class="stat-label">JS Backend</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">REST</div>
          <div class="stat-label">API Architecture</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">AI</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Video Analytics</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Features Section -->
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="parallax-bg"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2><span class="gradient-text">Key Features</span></h2>
      <p>
        The platform brings together AI-powered detection, live video
        streaming, cloud storage, and a full user management system —
        all built from scratch for the AI Security Camera System.
      </p>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path
                d="M17 10.5V7c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H4c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v10c0 .55.45 1 1 1h12c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-3.5l4 4v-11l-4 4zM14 13h-3v3H9v-3H6v-2h3V8h2v3h3v2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Live Camera Dashboard</h3>
          <p>
            A real-time web dashboard displaying all registered surveillance
            cameras. Users can browse, filter, and view live or recorded
            feeds directly from the browser with no additional software.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #00ffe5">
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Live Feed Viewer<br />
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Camera Management<br />
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Favourites System
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path
                d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>AI Object Detection</h3>
          <p>
            Integrates YOLOv8/YOLO11 deep learning models to detect and
            classify objects in video footage. Provides time-stamped
            detection logs, scene descriptions, and automated threat alerts.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #00ffe5">
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> YOLOv8 / YOLO11<br />
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Real-time Detection<br />
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Auto Logging
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path
                d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Secure Auth &amp; Access</h3>
          <p>
            Full user authentication with session management, role-based
            access for camera owners vs viewers, and encrypted credential
            storage — demonstrating full-stack security practices.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #00ffe5">
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Login / Signup<br />
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Session Management<br />
            <span class="highlight">✓</span> Role-Based Access
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tech Stack Section -->
  <section class="section section-gray">
    <div class="parallax-bg"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2><span class="gradient-text">Technology Stack</span></h2>
      <p>
        Built using industry-standard tools and frameworks, the project demonstrates
        practical knowledge of full-stack development, machine learning integration,
        and scalable system design.
      </p>
      <div class="feature-list">
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-title">
            <span class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M9 3L5 6.99h3V14h2V6.99h3L9 3zm7 14.01V10h-2v7.01h-3L15 21l4-3.99h-3z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            Backend — Node.js &amp; Express
          </div>
          <div class="feature-desc">
            The server is built with Node.js and Express, handling REST API
            routes for camera management, authentication, favourites, and AI
            analysis triggers. MongoDB is used for persistent data storage with
            Mongoose ODM for schema management.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-title">
            <span class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            Frontend — EJS &amp; TailwindCSS
          </div>
          <div class="feature-desc">
            Dynamic server-side rendered views using EJS templates styled with
            TailwindCSS. The UI is responsive, dark-themed, and includes
            animations and smooth transitions for a modern user experience.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-title">
            <span class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M13 2.05v2.02c3.95.49 7 3.85 7 7.93 0 4.08-3.05 7.44-7 7.93v2.02c5.05-.5 9-4.76 9-9.95s-3.95-9.45-9-9.95zM12 19c-3.87 0-7-3.13-7-7s3.13-7 7-7 7 3.13 7 7-3.13 7-7 7zm-1-11h2v6h-2zm0 8h2v2h-2z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            AI Layer — Python &amp; YOLO
          </div>
          <div class="feature-desc">
            A Python microservice using YOLOv8 / YOLO11 processes video frames
            and returns detection results to the Node.js server via internal
            APIs. Bull queues and Redis are used to handle asynchronous
            processing of video chunks without blocking the main server.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- System Architecture Section -->
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="parallax-bg"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2><span class="gradient-text">System Modules</span></h2>
      <p>
        The project is organized into clearly defined modules, each independently
        developed and tested, then integrated into the final system.
      </p>
      <div class="feature-list">
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-title">
            <span class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            Camera Management Module
          </div>
          <div class="feature-desc">
            Allows authenticated users to register new cameras, assign locations,
            upload video feeds, and update camera metadata. Camera owners can
            manage their devices from a dedicated host dashboard with full CRUD
            operations.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-title">
            <span class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            AI Analysis Pipeline
          </div>
          <div class="feature-desc">
            Video chunks are queued using Bull and processed by a Python
            YOLO worker. Results including object labels, timestamps, and
            scene summaries are stored in MongoDB and displayed in real-time
            alongside the video feed on the analysis page.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-title">
            <span class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
